; Check Inventory And Pick Up
;
; Used by the routines at #R$EB6D, #R$EB95, #R$EB9A, #R$EBC5, #R$EBCA, #R$EBCF,
; #R$EBE7, #R$EBFF, #R$ED1B, #R$ED20, #R$ED31, #R$ED3A, #R$ED65, #R$ED8B,
; #R$EDB1, #R$EDB6, #R$EDBB, #R$EDC0, #R$EDCA, #R$EDD3, #R$EDD8, #R$EDDD,
; #R$EDF5, #R$EE0F, #R$EE1C and #R$F5B3.
; .
; Check that the item can be taken, then pick it up.
;
; A Item ID
@label=Handler_CheckPlayerInventory_PickUpItem
c$EB54 CALL $EAF4    ; Call #R$EAF4.
 $EB57 JP $EB25      ; Jump to #R$EB25.
